msgid "A score fold uses every matching input contribution once, with no unrelated contribution. Example declaration: gmeow:ScoreFoldContributionBijectionConstraint rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
