msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryMergeCandidateUnionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Merge output candidate identities are exactly the union of input candidate identities. Example declaration: gmeow:QueryMergeCandidateUnionLaw rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
msgstr "Les identités des candidats en sortie sont exactement l’union de celles des entrées. Exemple de déclaration : gmeow:QueryMergeCandidateUnionLaw rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."

