msgid "The output carries exactly the original input loss nodes; their causes, constraints and acceptance attribution are not rewritten. Example declaration: gmeow:QueryMergeLossUnionLaw rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
msgstr "La sortie porte exactement les nœuds de pertes originaux ; causes, contraintes et attribution d’acceptation ne sont pas réécrites. Exemple de déclaration : gmeow:QueryMergeLossUnionLaw rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceAxisConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
