msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceSelectionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the selected graph, identities and source evidence; apply the canonical obligations in this module."
msgstr "Conserver le graphe sélectionné, les identités et éléments source ; appliquer les obligations canoniques du module."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryChoiceSelectionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A choice execution retains the matching, nonmatching or explicit unknown branch, never treating an absent verdict as false. Example declaration: gmeow:QueryChoiceSelectionLaw rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
msgstr "Une exécution garde la branche correspondante, non correspondante ou inconnue explicite, sans traiter un verdict absent comme faux. Exemple de déclaration : gmeow:QueryChoiceSelectionLaw rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryFeedbackPurityConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
