msgstr "Contrainte de liens de l’exécution d’itération"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationRunBindingsConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A recorded loop execution retains seed state zero, count, final state and explicit termination; every state index is at most the count."
msgstr "Une exécution garde graine zéro, compte, état final et fin explicite ; chaque indice est au plus le compte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationRunBindingsConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
