msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationRunBindingsConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A recorded loop execution retains seed state zero, count, final state and explicit termination; every state index is at most the count. Example declaration: gmeow:QueryIterationRunBindingsConstraint rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
msgstr "Une exécution garde graine zéro, compte, état final et fin explicite ; chaque indice est au plus le compte. Exemple de déclaration : gmeow:QueryIterationRunBindingsConstraint rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."

