msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationBodyEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Each positive state records an actual execution of the selected body from its previous retained state. Example declaration: gmeow:QueryIterationBodyEvidenceConstraint rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
